<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>CryptokiMan</title><description>CryptokiMan Manual</description><link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/</link><atom:link href="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <managingEditor>JayKim</managingEditor><language>en</language> <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:25:29 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:25:29 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.20.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>CryptokiMan</title> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/</link> </image> <item> <title>CryptokiMan Blog</title> <description>Read CryptokiMan news and articles about the PKCS #11 management utility.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/blog/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:58:38 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/blog/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Linux Install</title> <description>Install CryptokiMan on Linux from the ZIP package, extract the files, and start the PKCS #11 management tool from a terminal.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_linux/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:07:01 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_linux/</guid> </item> <item> <title>MacOS Install</title> <description>Find the current status of macOS download and installation instructions for CryptokiMan and links to general setup guidance.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_macos/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:07:01 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_macos/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Windows Install</title> <description>Install CryptokiMan on Windows using the setup wizard, choose an installation folder, and launch the PKCS #11 management tool.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_windows/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:07:01 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/install_windows/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Licnese Features</title> <description>Compare CryptokiMan features available with and without a valid license, including PKCS #11 sessions, object management, and cryptographic operations.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/license_features/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:53:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/license_features/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Getting Started</title> <description>Get started with CryptokiMan: load a PKCS #11 module, inspect tokens, open a session, log in, and manage objects.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/get_start/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:47:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/get_start/</guid> </item> <item> <title>CAVP</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Runs supported CAVP and ACVP test workflows using the selected Cryptoki slot, including Monte Carlo, request/response, and algorithm-specific tests.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CAVP_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CAVP_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Close Session</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Closes the selected session, or closes all sessions for the selected token.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CLOSE_SESSION_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CLOSE_SESSION_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Copy Object</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a copy of a selected token object. Review the source object, then set the attributes for the new copy.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/COPY_OBJECT_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/COPY_OBJECT_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create Data</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a PKCS #11 data object on the selected token with application data and object attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DATA_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DATA_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create DSA Private Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a DSA private-key object with key material, identifying information, and private-key usage attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DSA_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DSA_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create DSA Public Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a DSA public-key object with public-key material, domain parameters, and public-key usage attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DSA_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_DSA_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create ECDSA Private Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates an elliptic-curve private-key object, including curve parameters and private-key usage attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_EC_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_EC_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create ECDSA Public Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates an elliptic-curve public-key object with curve and point information and public-key usage attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_EC_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_EC_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a key object from selected key information and object attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create PQC Private Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a post-quantum cryptography private-key object for a supported algorithm and parameter set.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_PQC_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_PQC_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create PQC Public Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates a post-quantum cryptography public-key object for a supported algorithm and parameter set.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_PQC_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_PQC_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create RSA Private Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates an RSA private-key object from its key components and private-key attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_RSA_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_RSA_PRI_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Create RSA Public Key</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Creates an RSA public-key object from its modulus and public exponent, with configurable attributes.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_RSA_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/CREATE_RSA_PUB_KEY_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Decrypt</title> <description>CryptokiMan: Decrypts input data with a selected key and mechanism. It supports operation parameters, direct input or source files, and output to a destination file.</description> <link>https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/DECRYPT_DLG_EN/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:27:43 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/feed_rss_created.xml">CryptokiMan</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jykim74.github.io/cryptoki_manaual/user_guide/DECRYPT_DLG_EN/</guid> </item> </channel> </rss>